              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubuzuba obo, mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu, inembe iyakakankaminidwe mubusena mbwiingangamene iyoozunguna, iyoogonkwa akuwa, awalo mukuli iwakaanzikidwe alinjiyo uyootemwa, nkaambo mbuboobo Jehova mbwaamba.",
